# Gunvalkyrie (49470017; the Nova's iso is 5345000B-Gunvalkyrie.xiso.iso),
# Nova. Built from the generic survey 1790921696-titleroutes-1084287
# (lane.titleroutes session 63, reviewed session 64; re-read by
# lane.titleroutes2 session 1, 2026-10-02). Read from its route-frames, not
# guessed:
#   booted (005249): the ADX logo, start of the intro movie.
#   cycle 1 (005254 START / 005300 A): a "VALLEY 1 now loading" card (the
#     attract demo loading).
#   cycle 2 (005307 START / 005313 A): "now loading", then the intro art.
#   cycle 3 (005318 START / 005324 A): "Please press START to begin", then
#     NEW GAME / CONTINUE / OPTIONS.
#   cycle 4 (005330 / 005335): black (New Game's opening movie).
#   cycle 5 (005342 START / 005348 A): the briefing menu (NEXT STAGE, POWER
#     UP, FOE'S REPORT, SAVE, LOAD, OPTIONS, EXIT), then the Valley 1 map.
#   cycle 6 (005354 START / 005359 A): GO / MISSION OUTLINE / ENEMY /
#     CAUTION / BACK, then character select (Kelly).
#   cycle 7 (005405 START / 005411 A): "Send to insertion point? YES", then
#     "VALLEY 1 now loading".
#   cycle 8 (005418 START / 005423 A): the STAGE 1 Valley 1 card, then live
#     play (the HUD, Kelly warping in).
#   cycles 9-14: START opens the pause panel (Continue highlighted) and A
#     picks Continue, so a START/A pair in play is pause + resume.
#   play (005605): the tip "While jumping, pull the Left Trigger again to
#     perform a Rocket Boost" -- LT is jump/boost.
# So: 10 START/A cycles (8 reached play; the last 2 are a guard against a
# slower boot, and pause + resume if play came on time), mark, then a play
# loop with no START: forward on the left stick, RT fire, LT jumps, RX
# turns so a wall does not hold it. One A per cycle (the survey pressed A
# in play with no visible effect) also takes a Continue/Retry panel if one
# comes up. NOT YET REPLAYED: the first dispatch run's frames from the mark
# to the LAST frame decide whether it reached and stayed in play.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
repeat 10 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
wait 2
shot pre-mark
mark gameplay               # CHECK: Valley 1, the HUD, no pause panel over it
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    axis RT max
    wait 3
    axis RT min
    axis LT max
    wait 0.3
    axis LT min
    wait 2
    axis RX max
    wait 0.7
    axis RX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 3
    axis RT min
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    axis RX min
    wait 0.4
    axis RX mid
    press A
    wait 1
    shot play
}
